    "Help other learners decide whether to join your team by specifying some characteristics for your team. Choose carefully, because fewer people might be interested in joining your team if it seems too restrictive.": "Ajut\u0103-i pe ceilal\u021bi cursan\u021bi s\u0103 decid\u0103 dac\u0103 se al\u0103tur\u0103 echipei tale, specific\u00e2nd anumite caracteristici pentru echipa ta. Alege\u021bi cu grij\u0103, deoarece mai pu\u021bine persoane ar putea fi interesate s\u0103 se al\u0103ture echipei dvs. dac\u0103 vi se pare prea restrictiv.",
