    "ID-Verification is not required for this Professional Education course.": "Verificarea ID nu este necesar\u0103 pentru acest curs de educa\u021bie profesional\u0103.",
    "Identity Verification In Progress": "Verificare identitate \u00een curs de verificare",
    "If a learner starts on {startDate}, this subsection will be due on {projectedDueIn}.": "Dac\u0103 un cursant \u00eencepe pe {startDate}, aceast\u0103 subsec\u021biune va fi scadent\u0103 pe {projectedDueIn}.",
    "If the photos you submit are rejected, try moving the computer or camera orientation to change the lighting angle.  The most common reason for rejection is inability to read the text on the ID card.": "Dac\u0103 fotografiile pe care le trimite\u021bi sunt respinse, \u00eencerca\u021bi s\u0103 muta\u021bi orientarea computerului sau a camerei pentru a schimba unghiul de iluminare. Cel mai frecvent motiv de respingere este incapacitatea de a citi textul de pe cardul ID.",
    "If the subsection does not have a due date, learners always see their scores when they submit answers to assessments.": "Dac\u0103 subsec\u021biunea nu are o dat\u0103 limit\u0103, cursan\u021bii \u00ee\u0219i v\u0103d \u00eentotdeauna scorurile atunci c\u00e2nd trimit r\u0103spunsurile la evalu\u0103ri.",
    "If the unit was previously published and released to learners, any changes you made to the unit when it was hidden will now be visible to learners.": "Dac\u0103 unitatea a fost publicat\u0103 \u0219i lansat\u0103 anterior cursan\u021bilor, orice modific\u0103ri pe care le-a\u021bi f\u0103cut unit\u0103\u021bii c\u00e2nd a fost ascuns\u0103 vor fi acum vizibile pentru cursan\u021bi.",
    "If the unit was previously published and released to students, any changes you made to the unit when it was hidden will now be visible to students. Do you want to proceed?": "Dac\u0103 unitatea a fost publicat\u0103 \u0219i lansat\u0103 anterior studen\u021bilor, orice modific\u0103ri pe care le-a\u021bi f\u0103cut unit\u0103\u021bii atunci c\u00e2nd a fost ascuns\u0103 vor fi acum vizibile pentru studen\u021bi. Dori\u021bi s\u0103 continua\u021bi?",
    "If you do not yet have an account, use the button below to register.": "Dac\u0103 nu ai \u00eenc\u0103 un cont, folose\u0219te butonul de mai jos pentru a te \u00eenregistra.",
    "If you leave, you can no longer post in this team's discussions.Your place will be available to another learner.": "Dac\u0103 pleci, nu mai po\u021bi posta \u00een discu\u021biile acestei echipe. Locul t\u0103u va fi disponibil pentru alt cursant.",
    "If you make significant changes, make sure you notify members of the team before making these changes.": "Dac\u0103 face\u021bi modific\u0103ri semnificative, asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 notifica\u021bi membrii echipei \u00eenainte de a face aceste modific\u0103ri.",
    "If you make this %(xblockType)s visible to learners, learners will be able to see its content after the release date has passed and you have published the unit. Only units that are explicitly hidden from learners will remain hidden after you clear this option for the %(xblockType)s.": "Dac\u0103 face\u021bi acest %(xblockType)s vizibil pentru cursan\u021bi, cursan\u021bii vor putea s\u0103-i vad\u0103 con\u021binutul dup\u0103 ce data lans\u0103rii a trecut \u0219i a\u021bi publicat unitatea. Doar unit\u0103\u021bile care sunt ascunse \u00een mod explicit pentru cursan\u021bi vor r\u0103m\u00e2ne ascunse dup\u0103 ce debifa\u021bi aceast\u0103 op\u021biune pentru %(xblockType)s.",
    "If you make this section visible in the table of content, learners will be able to see its content.": "Dac\u0103 face\u021bi vizibil\u0103 aceast\u0103 sec\u021biune \u00een tabelul de con\u021binut, cursan\u021bii vor putea s\u0103-i vad\u0103 con\u021binutul.",
    "If you proceed, you will be unable to use this account to take courses on the {platformName} app, {siteName}, or any other site hosted by {platformName}.": "Dac\u0103 continua\u021bi, nu ve\u021bi putea folosi acest cont pentru a urma cursuri \u00een aplica\u021bia {platformName}, {siteName} sau orice alt site g\u0103zduit de {platformName}.",
    "If you remove this transcript, the transcript will not be available for any components that use this video.": "Dac\u0103 elimina\u021bi aceast\u0103 transcriere, transcrierea nu va fi disponibil\u0103 pentru nicio component\u0103 care utilizeaz\u0103 acest videoclip.",
    "If you remove this transcript, the transcript will not be available for this component.": "Dac\u0103 elimina\u021bi aceast\u0103 transcriere, transcrierea nu va fi disponibil\u0103 pentru aceste Componente.",
    "If you require assistance with taking either photo for submission, contact %(platformName)s support for additional suggestions.": "Dac\u0103 ave\u021bi nevoie de asisten\u021b\u0103 pentru a realiza oricare dintre fotografii pentru trimitere, contacta\u021bi asisten\u021ba %(platformName)s pentru sugestii suplimentare.",
    "If you select an option other than \"%(hide_label)s\", published units in this subsection become available to learners unless they are explicitly hidden.": "Dac\u0103 selecta\u021bi o alt\u0103 op\u021biune dec\u00e2t \u201e%(hide_label)s\u201d, unit\u0103\u021bile publicate \u00een aceast\u0103 subsec\u021biune devin disponibile pentru cursan\u021bi, cu excep\u021bia cazului \u00een care sunt ascunse \u00een mod explicit.",
    "If you still wish to continue and delete your account, please enter your account password:": "Dac\u0103 tot dori\u021bi s\u0103 continua\u021bi \u0219i s\u0103 v\u0103 \u0219terge\u021bi contul, v\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 introduce\u021bi parola contului:",
    "If you use the Advanced Editor, this problem will be converted to XML and you will not be able to return to the Simple Editor Interface.\n\nProceed to the Advanced Editor and convert this problem to XML?": "Dac\u0103 utiliza\u021bi Editorul Avansat, aceast\u0103 problem\u0103 va fi convertit\u0103 \u00een XML \u0219i nu ve\u021bi putea reveni la Interfa\u021ba Editor simpl\u0103.\n\nTrece\u021bi la Editorul Avansat \u0219i converti\u021bi aceast\u0103 problem\u0103 \u00een XML?",
    "If your device has changed, we recommend that you complete this course's onboarding exam in order to ensure that your setup still meets the requirements for proctoring.": "Dac\u0103 dispozitivul dvs. s-a schimbat, v\u0103 recomand\u0103m s\u0103 finaliza\u021bi examenul de integrare al acestui curs \u00een ordine pentru a v\u0103 asigura c\u0103 configura\u021bia dvs. \u00eendepline\u0219te \u00een continuare cerin\u021bele pentru supraveghere.",
