    "This proctored exam has been released to learners. You may not convert it to another type of special exam. You may revert this subsection back to being a basic exam by selecting 'None', or a timed exam, but you will NOT be able to configure it as a proctored exam in the future.": "Acest examen supravegheat a fost oferit cursan\u021bilor. Nu \u00eel pute\u021bi converti \u00eentr-un alt tip de examen special. Pute\u021bi reveni la aceast\u0103 subsec\u021biune la un examen de baz\u0103 select\u00e2nd \u201eNiciunul\u201d sau un examen cronometrat, dar NU o ve\u021bi putea configura ca examen supravegheat \u00een viitor.",
    "This response could not be marked as an answer. Refresh the page and try again.": "Acest r\u0103spuns nu a putut fi marcat ca r\u0103spuns. Actualiza\u021bi pagina \u0219i \u00eencerca\u021bi din nou.",
    "This response could not be marked as endorsed. Refresh the page and try again.": "Acest r\u0103spuns nu a putut fi marcat ca aprobat. Actualiza\u021bi pagina \u0219i \u00eencerca\u021bi din nou.",
    "This response could not be submitted.": "Acest r\u0103spuns nu a putut fi trimis.",
