    "Titles more than 100 characters may prevent students from printing their certificate on a single page.": "Titlurile de peste 100 de caractere pot \u00eempiedica cursan\u021bii s\u0103-\u0219i printeze Certificatul pe o singur\u0103 pagin\u0103.",
    "To access the course, select a session.": "Pentru a accesa cursul, selecta\u021bi o sesiune.",
    "To access the courses available to you through {enterpriseName}, visit the {enterpriseName} dashboard.": "Pentru a accesa cursurile disponibile prin {enterpriseName}, accesa\u021bi tabloul de bord {enterpriseName}.",
    "To be sure all students can access the video, we recommend providing both an .mp4 and a .webm version of your video. Click below to add a URL for another version. These URLs cannot be YouTube URLs. The first listed video that's compatible with the student's computer will play.": "Pentru a v\u0103 asigura c\u0103 to\u021bi studen\u021bii pot accesa videoclipul, v\u0103 recomand\u0103m s\u0103 furniza\u021bi at\u00e2t o versiune .mp4, c\u00e2t \u0219i o versiune .webm a videoclipului dvs. Face\u021bi clic mai jos pentru a ad\u0103uga o adres\u0103 URL pentru o alt\u0103 versiune. Aceste adrese URL nu pot fi adrese URL YouTube. Va fi redat primul videoclip listat care este compatibil cu computerul studentului.",
    "To continue learning with this account, sign in below.": "Pentru a continua s\u0103 \u00eenv\u0103\u021ba\u021bi cu acest cont, conecta\u021bi-v\u0103 mai jos.",
    "To hide the subsections and keep them accesible through links, you must adjust it from the section that contains them.": "Pentru a ascunde subsec\u021biunile \u0219i a le men\u021bine accesibile prin linkuri, trebuie s\u0103 o ajusta\u021bi din sec\u021biunea care le con\u021bine.",
    "To invalidate a certificate for a particular learner, add the username or email address below.": "Pentru a invalida un Certificat pentru un anumit cursant, ad\u0103uga\u021bi mai jos numele de utilizator sau adresa de e-mail.",
    "To receive a certificate, you must also verify your identity before {date}.": "Pentru a primi un atestat, trebuie s\u0103 v\u0103 verifica\u021bi identitatea \u00eenainte de {date}.",
    "To receive a certificate, you must also verify your identity.": "Pentru a primi un certificat, trebuie s\u0103 v\u0103 verifica\u021bi identitatea.",
    "To receive credit for problems, you must select \"Submit\" for each problem before you select \"End My Exam\".": "Pentru a primi credit pentru probleme, trebuie s\u0103 selectezi \u201eselecteaz\u0103\u201d pentru fiecare problem\u0103 \u00eenainte de a selecta \u201e\u00cencheia\u021bi-mi examenul\u201d.",
    "To review learner cohort assignments or see the results of uploading a CSV file, download course profile information or cohort results on the {link_start}Data Download{link_end} page.": "Pentru a examina temele de cohort\u0103 de cursan\u021bi sau pentru a vedea rezultatele \u00eenc\u0103rc\u0103rii unui fi\u0219ier CSV, desc\u0103rca\u021bi informa\u021biile despre profilul cursurilor sau rezultatele grupului de pe pagina {link_start} Desc\u0103rcare date {link_end} .",
    "To take a successful photo, make sure that:": "Pentru a face o fotografie de succes, asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103:",
    "To take the photo of your face, click on the camera button {icon}. If you need to try again, click 'Retake Photo'.": "Pentru a face fotografia fe\u021bei tale, d\u0103 clic pe butonul camerei {icon}. Dac\u0103 trebuie s\u0103 \u00eencerca\u021bi din nou, face\u021bi clic pe \u201eRelua\u021bi fotografia\u201d.",
    "To verify your identity, you need a webcam and a government-issued photo ID.": "Pentru a v\u0103 verifica identitatea, ave\u021bi nevoie de o camer\u0103 web \u0219i un ID cu fotografie emis de guvern.",
