    "Url": "Url",
    "Use Current Transcript": "Utiliza\u021bi transcrierea curent\u0103",
    "Use Onboarding to introduce learners to proctoring, verify their identity, and create an onboarding profile. Learners must complete the onboarding profile step prior to taking a proctored exam. Profile reviews take 2+ business days.": "Utiliza\u021bi Onboarding pentru a prezenta cursan\u021bilor supravegherea, pentru a le verifica identitatea \u0219i pentru a crea un profil de onboarding. Cursan\u021bii trebuie s\u0103 parcurg\u0103 pasul profilului de \u00eenscriere \u00eenainte de a sus\u021bine un examen supravegheat. Evalu\u0103rile profilului dureaz\u0103 peste 2 zile lucr\u0103toare.",
    "Use a practice proctored exam to introduce learners to the proctoring tools and processes. Results of a practice exam do not affect a learner's grade.": "Utiliza\u021bi un examen de supraveghere practic\u0103 pentru a prezenta cursan\u021bilor instrumentele \u0219i procesele de supraveghere. Rezultatele unui examen de practic\u0103 nu afecteaz\u0103 nota unui cursant.",
    "Use a timed exam to limit the time learners can spend on problems in this subsection. Learners must submit answers before the time expires. You can allow additional time for individual learners through the Instructor Dashboard.": "Utiliza\u021bi un examen cronometrat pentru a limita timpul pe care cursan\u021bii \u00eel pot petrece problemelor din aceast\u0103 subsec\u021biune. Cursan\u021bii trebuie s\u0103 trimit\u0103 r\u0103spunsuri \u00eenainte de expirarea timpului. Pute\u021bi acorda timp suplimentar cursan\u021bilor individuali prin Instructor Dashboard.",
    "Use as a Prerequisite": "Folose\u0219te ca cerin\u021b\u0103 prealabil\u0103",
    "Use bookmarks to help you easily return to courseware pages. To bookmark a page, click \"Bookmark this page\" under the page title.": "Utiliza\u021bi marcaje pentru a v\u0103 ajuta s\u0103 reveni\u021bi cu u\u0219urin\u021b\u0103 la paginile de cursuri. Pentru a marca o pagin\u0103, face\u021bi clic pe \u201eMarca\u021bi aceast\u0103 pagin\u0103\u201d sub titlul paginii.",
    "Use cohorts as the basis for dividing discussions. All learners, regardless of cohort, see the same discussion topics, but within divided topics, only members of the same cohort see and respond to each others\u2019 posts. ": "Folosi\u021bi cohortele ca baz\u0103 pentru \u00eemp\u0103r\u021birea discu\u021biilor. To\u021bi cursan\u021bii, indiferent de grup\u0103, v\u0103d acelea\u0219i subiecte de discu\u021bie, dar \u00een cadrul subiectelor \u00eemp\u0103r\u021bite, numai membrii aceleia\u0219i cohorte v\u0103d \u0219i r\u0103spund la post\u0103rile altele. ",
    "Use enrollment tracks as the basis for dividing discussions. All learners, regardless of their enrollment track, see the same discussion topics, but within divided topics, only learners who are in the same enrollment track see and respond to each others\u2019 posts.": "Utiliza\u021bi pistele de \u00eenscriere ca baz\u0103 pentru \u00eemp\u0103r\u021birea discu\u021biilor. To\u021bi cursan\u021bii, indiferent de calea lor de \u00eenscriere, v\u0103d acelea\u0219i subiecte de discu\u021bie, dar \u00een cadrul subiectelor \u00eemp\u0103r\u021bite, numai cursan\u021bii care se afl\u0103 pe aceea\u0219i cale de \u00eenscriere v\u0103d \u0219i r\u0103spund la post\u0103rile altelor.",
